Z||000021||Ambush||10-28-2001||11:27 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Monkeyman:<BR><B>Someone once suggested Nissan 300ZX headlights.  I looked in the boneyards once to see if I could find some to try, but the few boneyards that had them wanted waaaaay too much money.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><BR>And I'm still looking. I got the idea because most of the lamborghini kits use the Nissan Headlights. I've checked a few places out here and no one has them. the guys that say they can get them want 2-3 hundred each!<P>||||reg||1
